-- Name: FUNCTION voice_state(); Type: COMMENT; Schema: app; Owner: -
--

COMMENT ON FUNCTION app.voice_state() IS 'The state of play, small enough to brief a voice session with. Minted into Claire''s instructions when a call starts so that "what have we got on" needs no round trip. Read-only (0167).';


