COMMENT ON COLUMN public.collections.for_task_id IS '#71. The milestone whose documents these are, when the collection is a module''s shelf rather than a folder Grant made. `set null` on delete: losing the milestone must not destroy the documents'' grouping — ADR-0013''s rule that a route may close and the corpus is kept, one level down.';


--
-- Name: connection_health; Type: TABLE; Schema: public; Owner: -
