COMMENT ON TABLE public.connector_capabilities IS '#51. One row per thing a connector can be asked for. `reach` says whether the office can get at it programmatically; `used_by` says whether it bothers. The gap between the two is app.unused_capabilities(), which is where a proactive suggestion comes from (#52) rather than from an opinion.';


